# Explicit state-changing companion for recipes 09, 10 and 11 only.
# 48000 frames at 48000 Hz. First hear the original saved selection.
# At 12000, select both hidden A banks; at 24000, select both B banks.
# A/B selection reconnects cancelled routes and clears fixed modes.
# Thus recipe 10 starts silent; recipe 11 starts with its saved D#/F modes.
0 note_on upper 60 100
0 note_on lower 48 100
10000 note_off upper 60 0
10000 note_off lower 48 0
12000 select_bank upper 0 0
12000 select_bank lower 0 0
12000 note_on upper 64 100
12000 note_on lower 52 100
22000 note_off upper 64 0
22000 note_off lower 52 0
24000 select_bank upper 0 1
24000 select_bank lower 0 1
24000 note_on upper 67 100
24000 note_on lower 55 100
34000 note_off upper 67 0
34000 note_off lower 55 0
36000 pedal_on lower 1 100
44000 pedal_off lower 1 0
